      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perham%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "As the village grew, the surrounding township was renamed Perham Township in 1877.",
