      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perham%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Perham City Hall, built in 1906, served as council chambers, fire station, jail, and community hub.",
